2. launch-DeepResearch-Backend / launch-DeepResearch-Frontend
================================================================================

The system design, the FastAPI/Next.js split, and the frontend components this
project adapts come from Sean Chen's open-source companion repos:

    https://github.com/ShenSeanChen/launch-DeepResearch-Backend
    https://github.com/ShenSeanChen/launch-DeepResearch-Frontend
    Copyright (c) 2024 ShenSeanChen
    MIT License

    Accompanying walkthrough: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dw9Vkig47S0

Files adapted from those repos:

  - frontend/components/ResearchInterface.tsx  (rewritten data layer, UI retained)
  - frontend/components/ModelComparison.tsx    (rewritten against the job API)
  - frontend/contexts/ResearchContext.tsx      (credential storage removed)
  - frontend/app/page.tsx, layout.tsx, globals.css, components/ui/, public/
  - frontend/lib/googleDocs.ts, lib/utils.ts   (unmodified)

Everything else -- the job engine, provider registry, auth, webhooks, Redis
backend, MCP server, client SDKs and test suite -- is original to this project.

